  "details": "See the 1st image. The `General Accessibility` section is empty on the desktop mode (2024.2.3 Open Beta build 1468).\n\nI think it will confuse users and should be refined.\n\n- On the VR mode, the options in that category are `Holoport Locomotion` and `Responsive Menu`\n\n- The live (build 1458) shows the `Responsive Menu` there with desktop mode (2nd image).\n\n- So, I guess the dev \"fixed\" the inappropriate item (`Responsive Menu`) to be hidden with the desktop on build 1468.\n\nOverall, this is not `General Accessibility` right now. I suggest changing the section label to `VR mode Accessibility` and hiding the whole section on the desktop.",
